  UVU CIA SPY SCHOOL PROFILES ERASED AFTER THE ASSASSINATION

  Rusty Needs, a former CIA officer and professor in Utah Valley University's

  Center for National Security Studies (CNSS), had his staff profile online

  until after September 24th. Then it disappeared.

  And get this:

  Show more

  UVU National Security Society

  September 10,2019-6

  Hey UVU Students! TODAY, Tuesday 9/10/19 at 2:30 PM in CB 410A, you won't want
